  "title": "The New UX Era: The Prompt Is the Product",
  "summary": "We’ve entered a new UX era where AI collapses onboarding, Aha moments, and activation into a single prompt-driven flow. This post explains how modern SaaS products must redesign for intent, eliminate blank canvases, preload context, and create momentum through immediate next steps. Teams that evolve will deliver fast...",
